{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Glossary.GlossaryReebGaugeGroup","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Glossary.GlossaryReebGaugeGroup","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebGaugeGroup.carrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebGaugeGroup.carrier","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-reeb-gauge-group.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The R-group scheme carrier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebGaugeGroup.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebGaugeGroup.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-reeb-gauge-group.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebGaugeGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebGaugeGroup","kind":"structure","line":14,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-reeb-gauge-group.lean#L14-L30","doc":"The Reeb gauge group U₁(R) := T, the maximal torus of G_q.\n\nThis is the commutative subgroup that preserves the contact\nform θ and generates the Reeb flow.\n\nMaps to Mathlib: `Subgroup` of the gauge group, analogous\nto `TopologicalGroup.maximalTorus`.\n\n**`is_commutative : Prop` and `preserves_contact : Prop` removed 2026-09-07.\nBoth were typed with the *universe* `Prop`, so an instance chose the\nproposition; neither was read or constructed anywhere. `Commutative` is\nstatable once the group operation is a field; `preserves_contact` needs the\ncontact form.** ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:rem:glossary-reeb-gauge-group","label":"rem:glossary-reeb-gauge-group","md":"quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-reeb-gauge-group.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}